OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and rain, briefly heavy,
OL,6,Fwill extend southeast for a time this
OL,7,Fmorning. Then dry and brighter weather
OL,8,Ffollowing on behind. A few light
OL,9,Fshowers in the northwest later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMainly this evening, a few
OL,12,Fshowers in the northwest. Then the
OL,13,Frest of the night will be largely dry
OL,14,Fwith clear periods. Chilly in some
OL,15,Fsheltered glens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FDry for most of the day
OL,18,Fbefore rain spreads northeast in the
OL,19,Fevening. Some bright spells but
OL,20,Fclouding over from the south during
OL,21,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
