OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FOvernight rain on Thursday and Friday
OL,7,Fsoon clearing then mainly dry in the
OL,8,Feast, a few showers in the west.
OL,9,FBright spells and a few showers on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
